OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft outage hits South East
OL,4,ANHS trusts and councils
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS trusts and councils in south-east
OL,7,FEngland have been affected by the
OL,8,Fglobal Microsoft outage.
OL,10,FMicrosoft 365 Services, including
OL,11,FTeams, Outlook and Microsoft's
OL,12,Fartificial intelligence software
OL,13,FCopilot, were hit by "connectivity
OL,14,Fproblems", the company says.
OL,16,FOn Friday morning, most NHS trusts
OL,17,Facross Surrey, East and West Sussex,
OL,18,Fand Kent reported issues receiving and
OL,19,Fsending emails, while some said patient
OL,20,Finquiries and referral correspondences
OL,21,Fwere also affected.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
