OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft outage hits South East
OL,4,ANHS trusts and councils
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients have been urged to contact NHS
OL,7,Ftrusts by phone and to continue to
OL,8,Fattend planned appointments.
